                        <MySerializedTextPanelData>
                          <ChangeInterval>0</ChangeInterval>
                          <Font Type="MyObjectBuilder_FontDefinition" Subtype="Debug" />
                          <FontSize>1</FontSize>
                          <Text>Its been ages since that gate closed behind 
us, I dont know how much longer we can
keep scraping by. There are only so many 
spare parts left. What happens when we run 
out? If only we hadnt lost those dam 
hyperspace cores, we could just jump home.
I hope they know what they are doing with 
Kabal. Im worried those scavengers we ran 
into will get uppity once they figure out we 
are low on ammo.

</Text>
                          <ShowText>NONE</ShowText>
                          <FontColor>
                            <PackedValue>4294967295</PackedValue>
                            <X>255</X>
